WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,420
If this is sent to the auction house

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:03,420
Those foreign rich people have to break their heads

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:10,800
A dozen giant elephants gather together

4
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:18,070
This mountain monster in Daqingshan is indeed a big figure in their territory.

5
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,230
