16
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,780
This sword in my hand is as powerful as coal

17
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,060
Not a vegetarian

18
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:49,130
Don’t eat soft or hard food, right?

19
